{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new Shopify Online Store 2.0 section with a two-column editorial layout in the Bonne Soirée style — minimal, timeless, refined, and inspired by luxury fashion editorials.
    
    Purpose:
    
    Display one editorial image alongside structured text content.
    
    The section should be fully customizable from the Shopify Theme Editor without requiring code changes.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    LAYOUT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Desktop:
    
    • Two-column layout.
    • Image on the left.
    • Text on the right.
    • Columns should have balanced proportions.
    • The text block must always be vertically centered relative to the image.
    • Keep subtle spacing between image and text (clean editorial composition).
    • Plenty of white space, but never excessive.
    • Maximum section width around 1280px.
    • Center the entire section horizontally.
    
    Mobile:
    
    • Stack the image above the text.
    • Keep proportional spacing between the image and text.
    • Maintain generous side padding.
    • Preserve the selected text alignment.
    • Fully responsive.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    IMAGE
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Support independent Desktop and Mobile images.
    
    Settings:
    
    • Desktop image picker.
    • Mobile image picker.
    • If no mobile image is uploaded, automatically display the desktop image.
    
    Image behavior:
    
    • Preserve the original aspect ratio.
    • width: 100%.
    • height: auto.
    • object-fit: contain.
    • Never crop the image.
    • No rounded corners.
    • No borders.
    • No shadows.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TEXT CONTENT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Create THREE independent Rich Text blocks.
    
    Each block should be individually editable.
    
    Block 1
    Main Title
    
    Block 2
    First Subtitle
    
    Block 3
    Second Subtitle / Body Text
    
    Each text block must support Shopify Rich Text formatting.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TYPOGRAPHY CONTROLS
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Each text block must have its own independent typography settings inside the Theme Editor.
    
    For EACH of the three text blocks include:
    
    • Shopify Font Picker (font family)
    • Font size
    • Font weight
    • Letter spacing
    • Line height
    
    Do not hardcode fonts.
    
    Default font:
    Times New Roman (or the store's primary serif font).
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TEXT ALIGNMENT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Create one global Text Alignment setting.
    
    Options:
    
    • Left
    • Center
    • Right
    
    Default:
    
    Center
    
    The selected alignment must apply to all three text blocks.
    
    When Center is selected:
    
    • The entire text composition must be centered inside the right column.
    • Not only the text itself, but the whole text group.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TEXT SPACING
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include adjustable spacing controls for:
    
    • Title → Subtitle 1
    • Subtitle 1 → Subtitle 2
    
    Allow independent spacing values.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    BACKGROUND
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Background color selector.
    
    Default colors:
    
    • #FFFFFF
    • #F9F8F5
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    SECTION SPACING
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include editable controls for:
    
    • Top padding
    • Bottom padding
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    OPTIONAL LAYOUT SETTINGS
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include a Layout Direction selector.
    
    Options:
    
    • Image Left / Text Right (default)
    • Text Left / Image Right
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    STYLE
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    The overall feeling should be elegant, minimal and editorial.
    
    Inspired by luxury fashion brands such as Toteme, Khaite, The Row and Sézane.
    
    The composition should resemble a printed fashion magazine.
    
    Use generous but balanced white space.
    
    The typography should feel premium and timeless.
    
    The section must be fully responsive and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    BUTTON
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include one optional editorial button inside the text column.
    
    The button must appear directly below the text content (Main Title → First Subtitle → Second Subtitle), remaining inside the same text wrapper.
    
    It must never be rendered below the section or outside the two-column layout.
    
    The button should replicate the existing Bonne Soirée custom button component and follow exactly the same visual language.
    
    Design:
    
    • Rectangular shape.
    • No border-radius (perfectly straight edges).
    • Font: Times New Roman, serif.
    • Font weight: 400.
    • Uppercase text.
    • Editorial and minimal appearance.
    • Centered by default.
    • Smooth transition:
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    
    Customization settings:
    
    • Button text
    • Button link
    • Show / Hide button
    • Alignment (Left / Center / Right)
    
    Typography:
    
    • Shopify Font Picker
    • Font size
    • Letter spacing
    
    Colors:
    
    • Text color
    • Background color
    • Border color
    • Border thickness (px)
    
    Spacing:
    
    • Horizontal padding
    • Vertical padding
    • Margin above the button
    • Margin below the button
    
    Default appearance:
    
    • White background
    • Black text
    • 1px black border
    • Rectangular shape
    • No rounded corners
    
    Hover interaction:
    
    On hover:
    
    • Background becomes black (#000000).
    • Text becomes off-white (#F5F1EB).
    • Border becomes black (#000000).
    • Maintain transition:
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    
    Keep the normal state colors completely customizable.
    
    The hover effect must work on deskt
{% enddoc %}
```liquid
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-editorial-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    direction: rtl;
  }

  .ai-editorial-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} > * {
    direction: ltr;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 12px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-align-center-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-align-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-align-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-editorial-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.title_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.title_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-editorial-subtitle-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.title_to_subtitle_1_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-subtitle-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_to_subtitle_2_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.button_margin_top }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.button_margin_bottom }}px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.button_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-editorial-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.button_letter_spacing }}px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: {{ block.settings.button_border_thickness }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    border-radius: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-editorial-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #F5F1EB;
    border-color: #000000;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-editorial-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      direction: ltr;
    }

    .ai-editorial-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-editorial-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }

    .ai-editorial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-editorial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-editorial-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if block.settings.layout_direction == 'text_left' %}ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% endif %}">
      <div class="ai-editorial-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.image_desktop %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.height }}"
            class="ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <div class="ai-editorial-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              Next, add a desktop image
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.image_mobile %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image_mobile | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.height }}"
            class="ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% elsif block.settings.image_desktop %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.height }}"
            class="ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <div class="ai-editorial-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              Next, add a mobile image
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-align-{{ block.settings.text_alignment }}-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.title }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.subtitle_1 != blank %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-subtitle-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.subtitle_1 }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.subtitle_2 != blank %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-subtitle-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.subtitle_2 }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.show_button and block.settings.button_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <a
              href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}"
              class="ai-editorial-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
              {{ block.settings.button_text }}
            </a>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class EditorialSection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
      }
    }

    customElements.define('editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}', EditorialSection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

